5. Famous last words of the programmer

I`m  running  Flut  since  6  months  on  my  BBS  and  it was a continuous
development until today.

It`s running 100% stably. I never lost any datas until  now.

The  gamedatas are saved  when the last user leaves flut!   So if some Guru
happens the datas of the user(s) still in game are lost.

